# Cloudflare Pages serves these on every response. Deliberately narrow:
# Cloudflare already sets X-Content-Type-Options and Referrer-Policy at the
# edge, so only the genuinely missing headers are set here.
#
# No CSP: the edge injects its own inline scripts (email-address obfuscation
# and the bot-challenge platform), so a strict policy would break the live
# site rather than protect it.
# No HSTS: long max-age is effectively irreversible, and it belongs in the
# Cloudflare dashboard alongside the TLS settings, not in the build output.
/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
